+;******************************************************************************
+;* VP9 loop filter SIMD optimizations
+;*
+;* Copyright (C) 2013-2014 Clément Bœsch <u pkh me>
+;* Copyright (C) 2014 Ronald S. Bultje <rsbultje@gmail.com>
+;*
+;* This file is part of FFmpeg.
